    "Answer-level truth/regression cases for the production Knowledge/Jarvis path. This is separate from retrieval quality in rag-quality-set.json.",
    "npm run rag:truth -- --samples=1 is diagnostic. Acceptance requires --samples=3 and every case passing 3/3.",
    "Assertions combine the closed response state, warnings, server-validated cited evidence and robust answer concepts. They do not require one exact model string.",
    "Q18 remains in rag-quality-set.json as a known retrieval-ranking boundary and is not moved into this answer-level set."
  ],
